ct-rounding requirement is explicit; it does not claim ordinary PyTorch\nor CUDA sigmoid APIs universally promise correctly rounded outputs.\n\nFrozen environment: NVIDIA T4, PyTorch2.8.0, Triton3.4.0.\n",
